{"path":"filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/disable_recursion_pending","title":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::disable_recursion_pending","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::</span>disable_recursion_pending","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/disable_recursion_pending","section":"filesystem","kind":"page","summary":"Disables recursion to the currently referred subdirectory, if any.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> disable_recursion_pending<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Disables recursion to the currently referred subdirectory, if any.\n</p><p>The call modifies the pending recursion flag on the iterator in such a way that the next time <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/increment\"><code>increment</code></a> is called, the iterator will advance within the current directory even if it is currently referring to a subdirectory that hasn't been visited.\n</p><p>The status of the pending recursion flag can be queried with <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/recursion_pending\"><code>recursion_pending()</code></a>, which is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code> after this call. It is reset back to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> after <a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/increment\"><code>increment</code></a>, and its initial value is also <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>The behavior is undefined if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is the end iterator.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>May throw implementation-defined exceptions. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdlib&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;filesystem&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;fstream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> fs <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">filesystem</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">current_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">temp_directory_path</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_directories</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/c\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_directories</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/d/e\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_ofstream\"><span class=\"kw1750\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ofstream</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/a/b/file1.txt\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">create_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"a\"</span>, <span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox/syma\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/system\"><span class=\"kw978\">std::<span class=\"me2\">system</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"tree sandbox\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">recursive_directory_iterator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n         i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">recursive_directory_iterator</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n         <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i.<span class=\"me1\">depth</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">is_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>symlink_status<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" -&gt; \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">read_symlink</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n        <span class=\"co1\">// do not descend into \"b\"</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>i<span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>path<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">filename</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"b\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n            i.<span class=\"me1\">disable_recursion_pending</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    fs<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">remove_all</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"sandbox\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>sandbox\n├── a\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── b\n│&nbsp;&nbsp;     ├── c\n│&nbsp;&nbsp;     ├── d\n│&nbsp;&nbsp;     │&nbsp;&nbsp; └── e\n│&nbsp;&nbsp;     └── file1.txt\n└── syma -&gt; a\n&nbsp;\n\"sandbox/a\"\n  \"sandbox/a/b\"\n\"sandbox/syma\" -&gt; \"a\"</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/recursion_pending\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>recursion_pending</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  checks whether the recursion is disabled for the current directory <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator/increment\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>increment</span><span>operator++</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances to the next entry <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"filesystem","title":"Filesystem library (since C++17)"},{"path":"filesystem/recursive_directory_iterator","title":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::filesystem::recursive_directory_iterator::disable_recursion_pending","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Disables recursion to the currently referred subdirectory, if any."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"May throw implementation-defined exceptions."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"recursion_pending","note":"checks whether the recursion is disabled for the current directory"},{"label":"increment, operator++","note":"advances to the next entry"}]}]},"standards":["C++17"],"wordCount":234,"codeBlock